index="8" text="Letter Quiz includes listening practice with Play code word, Stop and a text alternative when you cannot use audio. Typed recall uses the canonical code word without a microphone. Listening text alternatives count toward the same practice score; pronunciation guides are not alternative typed answers." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.natophonetics.app.dev" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1130][1038,1478]" drawing-order="9" hint="" /><node index="9" text="Every submitted answer adds to local symbol progress, including listening text alternatives. Menu → Learning progress explains review times and offers Clear Progress. Reset Preferences keeps progress. Typed answers and recaps are not saved." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.natophonetics.app.dev" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1499][1038,1789]" drawing-order="10" hint="" /><node index="10" text="Starting another card, phrase, quiz answer or preview replaces the current audio. Stop, leaving the screen, editing converter text or backgrounding the app cancels the remaining words and pauses. If a provider does not finish, playback times out with a retry message." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.natophonetics.app.dev" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1810][1038,2074]" drawing-order="11" hint="" /><node index="11" text="Audio uses your device or browser speech provider. Some voices need a network connection. The app 